WEBVTT

00:06:08.233 --> 00:06:09.234
Good.

00:06:09.234 --> 00:06:10.235
One last time.

00:06:16.157 --> 00:06:17.158
Great.

00:06:19.394 --> 00:06:22.797
(Video) WhispersRed ASMR: So there
are lots of different things we need.

00:06:22.914 --> 00:06:27.168
Some we would have
in our regular spa kit.

00:06:27.669 --> 00:06:30.288
Some of them are quite obvious.